rd-stricter). Both real value.\n176\t- **llm.py thread (Wave 3-8):** L1 cost substrate (real, enabling) Â· L3 structured outputs (real\n177\t  robustness + safe degrade) Â· L4 budget_tokens guard + thinking fold (real â€” prevents Opus 4.8 400s,\n178\t  guards the $118 class). **L2 caching / L5 retarget / L6 batch are correct, honest, forward-ready\n179\t  PLUMBING that is largely INERT at Aurora's current prompt sizes + TOP_K=2** â€” exactly the research's\n180\t  \"validate before banking\" caveat, now measured.\n181\t- **Ground-truth gate:** `python -m pytest` = **915 passed** (+163 across the 8 waves from the 752\n182\t  Phase-1 baseline). No test weakening anywhere; security suite green throughout.\n183\t- **Locked-preserved intact:** KB schema + library, single-owner security gate, deterministic cost\n184\t  telemetry (post-call metering never altered by any wave), Helping Hand + publisher.\n185\t- **SEPARATELY-AUTHORIZED, NOT run:** H2 SA-1 (metered shadow batch) + SA-2 (live evidence-engine\n186\t  flip); the live H1 payload re-stamp against kb/aurora.db. All gated, default-off.\n187\t- **Commits:** 0eca5f2 (W1) Â· ffae677 (W2) Â· 2618f59 (W3) Â· 0a24914 (W4) Â· f046810 (W5) Â· e604fa4\n188\t  (W6) Â· 7b23c9e (W7) Â· + W8. Not pushed; awaiting John's review.\n189\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c3ebcf08-c961-4db6-8228-86ade240a49d","uuid":"f8f13d8a-39d2-427f-95fa-f961a5b895be","timestamp":"2026-06-13T12:51:43.387Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\dev\\aurora\\docs\\foreman-handoff-phase2\\EXECUTION-LOG.md","content":"# Aurora Phase 2 â€” Execution Log\n\nForeman records per-wave build outcomes below. 8 wave(s) planned\n(Wave 1-2 = security hardening H1-H2; Wave 3-8 = llm.py upgrades L1-L6).\n\n## Waves\n\n### Wave 1 â€” H1: Payload-depth security scan â€” GREEN (2026-06-06)\n\n- **Deliverable:** `bin/scan_payload_depth.py` â€” re-fetches each scannable artifact's\n  payload (payloads not retained on disk; reuses `fetche